CASE codes arm: a standing-rules section naming no code is a shortfall PASS codes_known=0/0 short=1
CASE cell arm: a cell carrying the emitted code plus another code is WRONG PASS WRONG:RECEIPT_REV_ABSENT,RECEIPT_REV_CONTENT_DRIFT
